{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9000_place", "source_sha256": "dd4110d9c1f96d435afed36cd9c74694583bd1134edee05b6db000256ba89b61", "ja": "渋谷センター街入口", "zh": "涩谷中心街入口", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9001_p", "source_sha256": "dddce425a8107f48aec917b51368dd5cf473284f5fb92272f0cefccc5334980f", "ja": "（今日はアイドル雑誌『ViDaVo!』の\nグラビア撮影。静香のテーマは『一途系女子』だ）", "zh": "（今天是偶像杂志《ViDaVo!》的写真拍摄。静香的主题是“一心一意系女孩”。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9002_015siz", "source_sha256": "cb22a2a6d3a4e1e41a05f4eee6179cef2967b2d69cd7f830a61f48824d7b5a48", "ja": "あの、今日のテーマですけど……かわいくて清楚だけど\nちょっと危ういところがある女の子、なんですよね？", "zh": "那个，关于今天的主题……是可爱又清纯，但又有些让人担心的女孩子，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9003_015siz", "source_sha256": "e4231a21e6303669defc357d3a7b8f8ef7c47a1bf07d5f274f7df5a798b12a64", "ja": "なんとなく、方向性は見えてるんですけど、\nまだ悩んでいる部分もあって……。", "zh": "大致已经看出方向了，不过还有些地方让我很纠结……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9004_p", "source_sha256": "4a0087ef40e43e15d923f995ccaca9aa63f1c5e46083bf801770bf732bc7b192", "ja": "なるほど……。『一途系女子』といっても、相手に\n依存したり、ただ一人に尽くしたり、色々だからな。", "zh": "原来如此……。虽说是“一心一意型女子”，但也有依赖对方的、只为一个人付出的，各种类型都有。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9005_015siz", "source_sha256": "9508f145fd68b9cf5a45a378cb71565cb765119b31e6f1287de5480d622523a3", "ja": "そうなんです……。{$P$}、\n私には、どういう感じが合っていると思いますか？", "zh": "就是这样……{$P$}，您觉得哪种感觉比较适合我呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9006_015siz", "source_sha256": "ff1476917e3b73ecd761a47f63dad1ae9c55669dc3eebc8e11ece4734764d068", "ja": "あっ。別にそれをやるというわけじゃなくて！\n……あくまでも参考にするだけです。", "zh": "啊，我也不是说非要照着做！\n……就只是拿来参考一下而已。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9007_p", "source_sha256": "a90233cb9928cfaa4d13b50b4e9be0ae3c785fde428a0fb4b494a468c0a0165e", "ja": "結構難しいな……。\nうーん、たとえばにはなるけど……。", "zh": "还真是挺难的啊……嗯，虽然只能拿来举个例子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9008", "source_sha256": "837cd3084c79fa8f99195e7f15d6018bc8e855c829fe0d1dcd8d38010feaca76", "ja": "独占型", "zh": "独占型", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9009", "source_sha256": "eb696bbe17fa8ad5ab6b16966a1cd9b16afeeffabae88c868879495c2bdc85ec", "ja": "妄想型", "zh": "妄想型", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9200_p", "source_sha256": "1de9ff3f07681ef87dabecb5e462df02807b3ea44847cca621fac3d60a7a0153", "ja": "独占型はどうだ？　ファンに見ていて欲しいと思う\n気持ちと似ているから、共感しやすいと思うんだ。", "zh": "独占型怎么样？因为和希望粉丝注视自己的\n那种心情很像，我觉得应该更容易引起共鸣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9201_015siz", "source_sha256": "0efcfbd44385e205993a4a3ab761e294a52fd97ca15871c72224c879308769b9", "ja": "独占型ですか。えっと……「あなたのそばには、\n私だけがいればいいんだよ。ふふっ、幸せだね♪」", "zh": "是独占型吗。那个……“你的身边只要有我一个就够了哦。呵呵，我们很幸福吧♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9202_015siz", "source_sha256": "34dbfcd0c69e92868321f60d1d493d30ab88d21ecf7d824a4e06ccae41fe9c36", "ja": "なるほど。実際にやってみるとイメージが掴めますね。\nこの調子で本番も頑張ります！", "zh": "原来如此。实际试着做一遍，就能抓住感觉了。\n我会保持这个状态，努力应对正式演出！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9300_p", "source_sha256": "1de9ff3f07681ef87dabecb5e462df02807b3ea44847cca621fac3d60a7a0153", "ja": "独占型はどうだ？　ファンに見ていて欲しいと思う\n気持ちと似ているから、共感しやすいと思うんだ。", "zh": "独占型怎么样？因为和希望粉丝注视自己的\n那种心情很像，我觉得应该更容易引起共鸣。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9301_015siz", "source_sha256": "1fe3b9e8405888cd419e15e1381bf505427a342e9c90160c74c232638505ce5e", "ja": "似てる……のかな？　でも、私のことを応援してほしい\n……見ていて欲しいと思う気持ちなら、確かに……。", "zh": "像吗……？不过，如果是希望大家为我加油……希望大家一直看着我的这种心情，那确实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9302_015siz", "source_sha256": "58c5a73e8d6a8987172786fbc4a192bfcec86d490022b80d5fd80ecfb22f2fd5", "ja": "うん。なんだか、できそうな気がしてきました。\nありがとうございます、{$P$}。", "zh": "嗯。总觉得，好像能做到了。\n谢谢您，{$P$}。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9500_p", "source_sha256": "0f1a5eef376b2346cb6fa57c2ceb4bd0d754745171e84e28ea912066047c92b5", "ja": "妄想型……つまり、架空の思い出を、実在したように\n思い込むタイプで。この衣装にも合うかもしれないな。", "zh": "妄想型……也就是把虚构的回忆，当成实际发生过一样\n坚信不疑的类型。说不定也很适合这套服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9501_015siz", "source_sha256": "daf896b02e3be0063d648e24f77c985d3f0d0c99589e88a153b975e41b937cbd", "ja": "……それ、一途なんですか？　いえ、でも……\nよくわからないですけど、少し練習してみますね。", "zh": "……那也算专一吗？不，不过……\n虽然不是很明白，我还是先练习一下吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9502_015siz", "source_sha256": "feb845b235335cbb4a98c8ef4add95caac1f6e91b21d319c201fa29419185b40", "ja": "「昨日は一緒に帰れて嬉しかったな。……覚えてない？\nそう？　あなたの背中、すごくかっこよかったよ♪」", "zh": "“昨天能和你一起回家真开心啊。……不记得了吗？\n是吗？你的背影，超级帅气哦♪”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9600_p", "source_sha256": "0f1a5eef376b2346cb6fa57c2ceb4bd0d754745171e84e28ea912066047c92b5", "ja": "妄想型……つまり、架空の思い出を、実在したように\n思い込むタイプで。この衣装にも合うかもしれないな。", "zh": "妄想型……也就是把虚构的回忆，当成实际发生过一样\n坚信不疑的类型。说不定也很适合这套服装呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9601_015siz", "source_sha256": "f3e5a24050035b97c487f41a198628fd774e52fbca1514f5c9299167f9e3911d", "ja": "それって……{$P$}が、知らない人に\n恋人と思われている……。そんな感じですか？", "zh": "那就是说……{$P$}被陌生人误以为是恋人……是这种感觉吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "job_story_015siz_9000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_015siz_9602_015siz", "source_sha256": "266269630d7394ed1697df3b492d0d62e642807c80bd618adcfd75c53ba6c0d0", "ja": "なんで青ざめてるんですか？　今のはたとえですよ。\nでもそう考えたら、少しわかった気がします。", "zh": "为什么脸色发白？刚才只是打个比方。\n不过这样一想，我好像有点明白了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
